==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sh|sla-pro|*pъtica}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{m|ine-pro|*peth₂-||to fly}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|feather}}, {{m|en|pen}}, {{cog|grc|πέτομαι}}, {{m|grc|πτέρυξ}} (whence {{m|en|pterodactyl}}, {{m|en|archæopteryx}}, {{cog|el|φτερό}}, {{m|el|πτηνό}}), {{cog|la|petō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sh-IPA|ptȉca}}
* {{hyphenation|sh|pti|ca}}
* {{rhymes|sh|ica|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{sh-noun|g=f|head=ptȉca}}

